      "lines": [
        "3. 设 $D>0$. 我们把分式 $\\frac{D}{4a^2}$ 写成平方的形式：$\\frac{D}{4a^2}=↵\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)^2$. 那么方程（1）就和下列方程同解："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)^2=0$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "就是"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}+\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)\\left(x+\\frac{b}{2a}-\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}\\right)=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由此得："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x+\\frac{b}{2a}+\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=0$　或　$x+\\frac{b}{2a}-\\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{2a}=0$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "就是"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x=\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$　或　$x=\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程（1）有两个根："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{-b-\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$　和　$\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "可采用下面的简便写法："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{D}}{2a}$，其中　$D=b^2-4ac$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们把它叫做二次方程的根的公式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们看到，二次方程的根是不是存在以及根的个数决定",
        "于表示式 $D=b^2-4ac$ 的值. 这个表示式叫做二次方程的判",
        "别式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们已经知道，当 $D<0$ 时，方程没有根；当 $D=0$ 时，"
